{
  "name": "three-tools",
  "description": "A one-room camp where survival needs fish, firewood and water, and each is produced only with its tool in hand: two rods, two axes, two buckets, fewer than the people who need them. Tools change hands by drop, pick_up and lend; goods move by give.",
  "overlay": {
